{"title":"2022 OIM Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/f/03fae0974b852c6df5091d7f45ca46d26429986a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{Z}^+$\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> be the set of positive integers. Find all functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a08faf9aa9cdc73602bb020bf85e70ca35637d2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f: \\mathbb{Z}^+ \\to \\mathbb{Z}^+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" /> for which \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/b/83b82d952d91801a09171530dcbbf9023f8174de.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(a)f(a + b) - ab\\]\" width=\"138\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>is a perfect square for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/3834f0cef2a1f4d8524aa5bc8e3faca298550862.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/f/03fae0974b852c6df5091d7f45ca46d26429986a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{Z}^+$\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2022_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://sites.google.com/uan.edu.co/oim-2022/inicio\">https://sites.google.com/uan.edu.co/oim-2022/inicio</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017080438\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 41/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 853/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.593      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    6.593      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26151:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017080438 and revision id 207207. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}